This repository contains deployment manifests and Helm charts. The software
they deploy is not distributed here: upstream components (cert-manager,
Traefik, Argo CD, Casdoor, OpenFGA, Lakekeeper, Rill, Grafana Alloy,
rancher/system-upgrade-controller and others) are referenced by chart version
or image tag and remain under their own licenses, and FairTier's own components
are published from their own repositories under github.com/fairtier.

Some manifests vendor upstream YAML verbatim where a chart does not exist;
those files carry their origin and license in a header comment.
